    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**** Open viewing Saturday 3rd October 2026 11am - 11:20am ****\r\nPlease contact Siobhan on 087 2737812 or email siobhan@lynam.ie\r\n\r\nLynam Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market a stunning Sorohan ground floor 2 bed apartment with it's own front door access.  Built to a very high specification and in excellent order throughout with 2 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms that has a large open plan kitchen/dining and living room. \r\n\r\nFor anyone that doesn’t know Trimbleston; rest assured its set apart from all other complexes. The grounds are exceptionally well maintained and managed both from an exterior and interior perspective.\r\n\r\nThe complex is one of the more modern developments with a modern architecture apparent in the design while being complimented by the beautiful landscaping throughout the complex. This own door apartment is tucked away in a quiet corner, free from any excessive traffic noise while still being ideally located within the complex. \r\nAccommodation briefly comprises of: \r\nA well proportioned living/dining room with seperate kitchen, 2 attractive bedrooms, one en suite, spacious bathroom, separate utility room..  GFCH, Alarm system, Double glazed windows.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none for convenience with the LUAS within walking distance.  Easy access to the N11, M50, and City Centre.  Goatstown, Sandyford, Ranelagh, Milltown, Stillorgan and Blackrock are also all within easy driving distance. Some of Dublin’s finest schools including St Kilian’s, Mount Anville, Our Lady’s Grove are all within easy reach.  UCD/Smurfit business school are also within an easy distance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tSOROHAN BUILT TO A VERY HIGH SPECIFICATION\r\n•\tDESIGNATED PARKING PLUS VISITOR PARKING\r\n•\tGROUND FLOOR APARTMENT WITH OWN DOOR\r\n•\tEXCEPTIONAL DEVELOPMENT\r\n•\tWELL MAINTAINED GROUNDS\r\n•\tDOUBLE GLAZED HARDWOOD WINDOWS AND DOORS THROUGHOUT\r\n•\tEXCELLENT LOCATION WITH THE M50/N11 WITHIN MINUTES\r\n•\tWALK TO LUAS\r\n•\tNUMBER 11 TO CITY CENTRE ON MAIN GOATSTOWN ROAD\r\n•\tUCD/SMURFIT BUSINESS SCHOOL.\r\n•\tTOP SCHOOLS WITHIN EASY REACH"
